b:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm","children":"karachi's current weather in June 2026 shows a temperature of 30°C, feeling like 35°C with clear sky. Humidity levels are at 76%, with winds moving at 37 km/h. For residents and visitors in karachi, these conditions are comfortable for most outdoor activities. karachi's climate (موسم) during June follows the pattern of the Upper Indus Plain — the city's position in the Punjab heartland means temperatures can vary significantly between morning and afternoon. Locals heading to Anarkali Bazaar, Model Town, or DHA are advised to check the hourly forecast above for the best time to travel. The weather data on this page is sourced live from OpenWeatherMap and updates every hour."}]
