on","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-medium text-sm text-amber-900","children":"Lacquerware"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-amber-600 mt-1","children":"View story & buy →"}]]}],["$","a","lahore-brassware",{"href":"/products/lahore-brassware","className":"bg-amber-50 border border-amber-100 hover:border-amber-300 rounded-xl p-4 transition","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-medium text-sm text-amber-900","children":"Brass & Copperware"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-amber-600 mt-1","children":"View story & buy →"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm","children":"karachi's heritage products (دستکاری) represent centuries of craftsmanship that have survived empires, partitions, and modernisation. In June 2026, artisans across the city's historic mohallas continue to produce the hand-embroidered phulkari shawls, Kashmiri shawls, hand-knotted rugs, lacquerware, and the intricate woodwork that made Mughal-era karachi the envy of the known world. The iconic Lahori chappals — sturdy leather sandals handmade in the walled city's cobbler lanes — remain a symbol of the city's identity worn by everyone from daily labourers to fashion-conscious youth. karachi's craftspeople sell their work through the heritage bazaars of Anarkali, Shah Alam Market, and the newer Lahore Crafts Council outlets, as well as internationally through platforms like Amazon, Etsy, and 1stDibs. The Heritage Products section above features rotating monthly spotlights on individual artisans and product categories, with links to purchase authentic items directly."}]]}]
25:T42a,karachi's street food (لاہوری کھانا) is internationally recognised as some of the finest in South Asia, and in June 2026 the city's food street culture continues to draw visitors from across Pakistan and abroad. No visit to karachi is complete without a breakfast of paye (slow-cooked trotters) at Waris Nihari on Lakshmi Chowk, a lunch of slow-roasted mutton karahi in the Data Darbar lanes, or the legendary evening experience of Food Street near the Badshahi Mosque — where dozens of vendors compete to offer the finest seekh kebabs, brain masala, and the city's signature murgh cholay. The sweet shops of karachi, particularly Shezan and Gourmet, produce the halwa puri, jalebi, and gulab jamun that set the standard across Pakistan. In June 2026, karachi's restaurant scene has expanded dramatically beyond traditional Punjabi fare to include Japanese, Italian, and Korean cuisines — especially in the Defence Housing Authority and Gulberg neighbourhoods — but the street food of the walled city remains the soul of karachi's culinary identity.17:["$","section",null,{"id":"food","className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"Playfair Display, serif"},"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-[#01411C] mb-4","children":["🍛 Street Food of ","karachi"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-6","children":[["$","div","Nihari",{"className":"bg-orange-50 rounded-xl p-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-orange-800","children":"Nihari"}],["$","div","Seekh Kebabs",{"className":"bg-orange-50 rounded-xl p-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-orange-800","children":"Seekh Kebabs"}],["$","div","Paye",{"className":"bg-orange-50 rounded-xl p-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-orange-800","children":"Paye"}],["$","div","Halwa Puri",{"className":"bg-orange-50 rounded-xl p-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-orange-800","children":"Halwa Puri"}],["$","div","Brain Masala",{"className":"bg-orange-50 rounded-xl p-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-orange-800","children":"Brain Masala"}],["$","div","Karahi",{"className":"bg-orange-50 rounded-xl p-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-orange-800","children":"Karahi"}],["$","div","Jalebi",{"className":"bg-orange-50 rounded-xl p-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-orange-800","children":"Jalebi"}],["$","div","Murgh Cholay",{"className":"bg-orange-50 rounded-xl p-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-orange-800","children":"Murgh Cholay"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm","children":"$25"}]]}]
