26:T47e,karachi — known locally as لاہور — is Karachi is the capital city of the province of Sindh, Pakistan. It is the largest city in Pakistan and 12th largest in the world, with a population of over 20 million. It is situated at the southern tip of the country along the Arabian Sea coast and formerly served as the country's capital from 1947 to 1959. Ranked as a beta-global city, it is Pakistan's premier industrial and financial centre, with an estimated GDP of over $200 billion (PPP) as of 2021. As of June 2026, the city serves as the capital of sindh and remains a cornerstone of pakistan's cultural, economic, and intellectual identity. Home to world-class universities, centuries-old mosques, and a food scene celebrated across South Asia, karachi offers visitors and residents an experience unlike any other city on the subcontinent. This page provides live, real-time information for karachi including current weather conditions, today's prayer times (اوقات نماز), gold and currency rates, breaking news, upcoming events, and much more — all updated continuously to serve the people of karachi and those planning to visit.1a:["$","section",null,{"id":"glance","className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontFamily":"Playfair Display, serif"},"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-[#01411C] mb-4","children":["📋 ","karachi"," at a Glance — ",2026]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6","children":[["$","div","Population",{"className":"bg-[#F5F3EE] rounded-xl p-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-gray-500","children":"Population"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-[#01411C] mt-1","children":"13M+"}]]}],["$","div","Area",{"className":"bg-[#F5F3EE] rounded-xl p-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-gray-500","children":"Area"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-[#01411C] mt-1","children":"1,772 km²"}]]}],["$","div","Elevation"